      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 1999 Wiley-Liss, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "A patient with an angiographically unrecognized minor coronary dissection in a stent-covered coronary segment in which a type D spiral dissection extended submedially to the distal artery is described. This complication occurred 6 months after stent implantation and was ascribed to injury of the stented vessel wall during an intravascular ultrasound study."
      },
